OL,3,GNEWSAHuman trafficking 'hidden in plain
OL,4,Asight' online
OL,5,
OL,6,FHuman trafficking is a "catastrophic"
OL,7,Fproblem that is being "hidden in plain
OL,8,Fsight online", a Stormont inquiry has
OL,9,Ffound.
OL,11,FThe investigation into "pimping
OL,12,Fwebsites" in Northern Ireland was
OL,13,Fprompted by growing concerns about the
OL,14,Fexploitation of trafficked and
OL,15,Fvulnerable women on online platforms.
OL,17,FThe All-Party Group (APG) on Human
OL,18,FTrafficking and Commercial Sexual
OL,19,FExploitation is due to release its
OL,20,Finquiry report on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
